<title>USA: Royal Appliance Mfg. Co Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Royal Appliance Mfg. Co Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p>3 months to December 31</p>
<p>			   (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p> Net sales			    $97,204		   $96,303</p>
<p> Net income (a),			4,625		     2,789</p>
<p> Per share (a),			   .19			 .12</p>
<p> Weighted average number of	24,451		    23,999</p>
<p>common shares outstanding  </p>
<p>12 months to December 31</p>
<p> Net sales			    286,123		   270,564</p>
<p> Net income (loss) (a),	     9,436		  (13,756)</p>
<p> Per share (a),			   .39		     (.57)</p>
<p> Weighted average number of	24,213		    23,999</p>
<p>common shares outstanding</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Amounts for the three and twelve month period ended December 31, 1995, include special charges of $218,000 ($160,000 after-tax) and $16,294,000 ($11,110,000 after-tax), respectively.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
